        "text": "AI-powered healthcare conversations scale up Synphony AI agent, DORA, is set to assist Emilio patients in the next two years DORA, a clinical conversation AI development by Synphony, has already conducted around 200,000 real clinical calls across 20 hospitals in the UK The AI is designed to handle post-operative follow-ups and pre-operative checks, freeing up clinicians' time for more critical tasks As the company expands its service in the US, it aims to scale its operations to serve Emilio patients within the next two years, ensuring its safety and effectiveness as it grows",
